Roland, Ardsley asked us to price the deletion of Section 09 05 61 in its e=
ntirety. Substitution Request SR-014 is attached with the numbers.<br />
<br />
Deleting the moisture vapor barrier across 142,000 square feet at $2.45 per=
 square foot returns a credit of $347,900 and removes 18 calendar days from=
 the flooring sequence, which pulls substantial completion back inside the =
lease commencement date Ardsley is working to.<br />
<br />
To be clear about where Thackston Bell sits: we are pricing this because th=
e owner asked us to price it. We are not recommending it and we will not pr=
oceed without an ASI.
